diff --git a/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt b/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1e1e439
--- /dev/null
+++ b/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+Kittygram on Utilibre
+Upstream: https://codeberg.org/irelephant/kittygram
+Revision: 5931c21c0990d4b216e97166dd78c03c9965567a
+License: AGPL-3.0; original notices retained.
+
+Utilibre changes: HTTPS-only media allowlist using exact CDN suffix boundaries,
+verified TLS, time/body limits, no double URL decoding, bounded cookie lifetime,
+read-only/non-root runtime support, disabled request logs and native operator/source
+disclosures. No Instagram account cookies, third-party proxies or HTTP impersonation
+sidecar are used. Public API/token registration is blocked at the gateway.
+
+Build: docker build -f Dockerfile.utilibre -t utilibre-kittygram:5931c21-p1 .
+Lapis version is pinned; UTILIBRE-LUA-PACKAGES.txt records build module versions.
+Git LFS image assets are included as actual files. SQLite public-profile lookup
+cache (64 MiB filesystem) and Valkey cache (128 MiB maximum) are RAM-only. Native
+language/theme preferences use a signed Secure/HttpOnly/SameSite=Lax cookie.
+Generate a private signing secret with deployment/init-kittygram.mjs; it is not
+part of corresponding source. No user account database is hosted by this service.
